{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ZmkAJLL2aZ1792745117.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地股市先跌後倒升。</p><p></p><p>上證綜合指數以接近全日高位收市。深圳創業板指數升幅較大，收市升逾百分之4。 《彭博》報道有多隻ETF成交額急增，可能是「國家隊」入市。滬深京三市成交增加，至1.97萬億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>機械人概念造好，半導體板塊回升。至於寧德時代A股，亦升近百分之8。</p><p></p><p>總計全周表現，四大指數則全線下跌。滬深300指數連跌第11個星期。其餘三大指數都五連跌。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:41.081348+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T13:38:08.896770+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:38:49.176006+00:00","content_hash":"515aafa9cfacbde4c100b9016e0c4a9584c5b35f0f0635b23dfb5ceb1f29df14","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:41.081348+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}